offer.body=A covered cutting room and an open drying yard would make a fine tannery. I can teach your Apprentices to turn hides into leather and make the satchels our couriers need.
accepted.body=Take this tannery plan. The drying yard should stay open and the cutting benches need a clear path.
cancel=I need to put this project aside.
building.body=I will keep my things packed until the tannery is ready. The plot plan lists the materials we need.
cancelled.body=All right. Find me when you are ready to begin again.
back=Understood.
welcome.body=We are ready to begin. Ask about workplace upgrades to unlock Leatherworking. A workplace needs a tanning rack, hides in town storage and an Apprentice with Leatherworking enabled in the journal.
how.body=Leatherworking sites prepare leather and leather goods at tanning racks. Tasks list the materials and skill needed. Couriers bring the supplies and an Apprentice must work to finish each task. Collect the leather and bags from Crafted Goods in the warehouse. Higher skill opens tougher hides and better equipment.
gift.confirm=You brought something for me? Let me see.
